+</span><br/><span id="fn11"><a href="#r11">11</a>&nbsp;Job xxxi. 34 [LXX.].
+</span><br/><span id="fn12"><a href="#r12">12</a>&nbsp;1 Sam. [1 Kings] xix. 4.
+</span><br/><span id="fn13"><a href="#r13">13</a>&nbsp;1 Sam. [1 Kings] xix. 5
+</span><br/><span id="fn14"><a href="#r14">14</a>&nbsp;2 Sam. [2 Kings] iii. 28.
+</span><br/><span id="fn15"><a href="#r15">15</a>&nbsp;S. Matt. xxviii. 20.
+</span><br/><span id="fn16"><a href="#r16">16</a>&nbsp;Eccles. iii. 1.
+</span><br/><span id="fn17"><a href="#r17">17</a>&nbsp;Ps. cxix. [cxviii.] 126.
+</span><br/><span id="fn18"><a href="#r18">18</a>&nbsp;Ps. lxix. [lxviii.] 13.
+</span><br/><span id="fn19"><a href="#r19">19</a>&nbsp;S. S. Matt. ix. 13.
