+</span><br/><span id="fn205"><a href="#r205">205</a>&nbsp;And so de Syn. §46. `we have on careful inquiry ascertained, &amp;c.' Again, `I have acquainted myself on their account [the Arians'] with the meaning of agenhton twn egkukliwn
+</span><br/><span id="fn206"><a href="#r206">206</a>&nbsp;Four senses of agenhton
